HOW TO READ THIS COMPARISON
09:05:13  ───────────────────────────
09:05:13    Tiers split only with ≥24 scored pages and more than one represented tier. Families appear with --report-details.
09:05:13    Outliers: ≥3 scored engines, all ≤0.25, no failed/pending participant. Same excluded cases for all engines.
09:05:13    Low scores may reflect hard pages, reference errors or scorer limits; Full remains the primary result.
09:05:13    Costs/times use successful scored pages and their saved serving pass; steady-state where recorded.
09:05:13    Shared calls are paid once; do not sum costs across legs. Failed-call, startup and judge spend are excluded.
09:05:13    Supporting metrics use Full pages; a parenthesized count indicates fewer metric-reference pages.
09:05:13    No outl can decrease: exclusions change family means. Local $0 excludes machine expense.
09:05:13    Errors and N/A are excluded from means, not scored as zeros. Unequal page coverage can change rankings.
09:05:13    --report-sort cer|wer|f1|without-outliers|cost|latency changes ordering; unsupported metrics fall back to Full.
09:05:13    --report-details adds family breakdowns, other metrics, diagnostics and local CSV exports.
